  "story": {
    "day": 121,
    "title": "Kaya's Travel Dream Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Yesterday, Kaya went to school early.",
      "Her fourth class was history, Mrs. Lee taught.",
      "They learned of an old battle and court.",
      "Kaya saw notes on the blackboard.",
      "She knew her plan to travel to a country was the way.",
      "She imagined an actor in a musical there.",
      "Kaya would sit and move around a big hotel.",
      "\"Be careful!\" her mom would always say. \"Don't leave anything else.\"",
      "Kaya ate roast chicken and drank barley tea. \"We will stop at the airport.\"",
      "There was much laughter during her last lesson.",
      "She volunteered to finish cleaning and put away the books.",
      "Finally, she took her bag. Her bus left in thirty minutes."
    ]
  }
